{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/message_from_administration_neon.png?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attention Operator, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been selected to oversee a critical mission. Our team of elite soldiers is set to descend into a newly discovered abyss, believed to lead to uncharted territories beneath the earth. Your role is to monitor the soldiers' progress, ensuring their safety and collecting data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/eol_neon.png?t=1745356569\" /> <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/TerminalsNarrowOprimize.gif?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/monitor_your_terminals_neon.png?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As they venture deeper, remain vigilant and provide guidance based on their transmissions. You will have access to a status monitor, a radar, a radio to scan various frequencies, and other equipment to assist in your mission.<br>Be aware that communication may become sporadic as they descend. Strange anomalies have already been detected, and the nature of the abyss remains unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/eol_neon.png?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/InspectNarrowOptimize.gif?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/explore_inspect_uncover_neon.png?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for the unexpected and maintain operational readiness at all times. Prepare to face the unimaginable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">End of message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/eof_neon.png?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/Cintas-large.gif?t=1745356569\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3243360?t=1745356569","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/470d01f153f44c36d17a55f0988a276e5bfbb055/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745356569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/b38c17381263f55bcee2c5adf9d2549b0dfbce26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745356569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/b38c17381263f55bcee2c5adf9d2549b0dfbce26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745356569","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":" There may be blood, corpses, disfigured and semi-naked creatures."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/message_from_administration_neon.png?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attention Operator, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been selected to oversee a critical mission. Our team of elite soldiers is set to descend into a newly discovered abyss, believed to lead to uncharted territories beneath the earth. Your role is to monitor the soldiers' progress, ensuring their safety and collecting data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/eol_neon.png?t=1745356569\" /> <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/TerminalsNarrowOprimize.gif?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/monitor_your_terminals_neon.png?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As they venture deeper, remain vigilant and provide guidance based on their transmissions. You will have access to a status monitor, a radar, a radio to scan various frequencies, and other equipment to assist in your mission.<br>Be aware that communication may become sporadic as they descend. Strange anomalies have already been detected, and the nature of the abyss remains unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/eol_neon.png?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/InspectNarrowOptimize.gif?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/explore_inspect_uncover_neon.png?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for the unexpected and maintain operational readiness at all times. Prepare to face the unimaginable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">End of message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243360/extras/eof_neon.png?t=1745356569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/324336